on mouseUp
  [  0] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  4] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <3, 1>
  [  6] extcall 3 ............................... puppetSprite(3, 1)
  [  8] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 10] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <10>
  [ 12] extcall 37 .............................. puppetTransition(10)
  [ 14] pushcons 0 .............................. <"exit">
  [ 16] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"exit">
  [ 18] extcall 7 ............................... go("exit")
  [ 20] ret
end
